A process that crashes in the middle of a write can leave an incomplete last line. Readers skip
lines they can't parse, so an incomplete {{ N }} is simply not there.{{ " When the file reaches\n`max_bytes` it is rotated: `<path>.1` is the newest rotated file, `<path>.2` the one before, and so on." if rotation }}
